{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53063","headline":"诗 · 郎士元","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"假守昭平郡，当门桂水清。\n海遥稀蚌迹，峡近足滩声。\n峡东江盘天影随，轻船只下几危机。\n初晴古木猿三叫，未晚阴崖日半规。\n篁竹数家何处是？清清一曲几首诗。\n（《四库》本《记纂渊海》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}